  "title": "NETSTREIT Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2025 Financial and Operating Results",
  "summary": "– Net Income of $0.02 and Adjusted Funds from Operations (\"AFFO\") of $0.33 Per Diluted Share for Fourth Quarter – – Completed Record Gross Investment Activity of $245.4 Million at 7.5% Blended Cash Yield for Fourth Quarter – – Reaffirms 2026 AFFO Per Share Guidance of $1.35 to $1.39 – – Increases Quarterly Dividend by 2.3% to $0.22 Per Share – – $46.4 Million of Forward Equity Sales through the ATM in January 2026 – – Achieved Investment Grade Rating of BBB- from Fitch Ratings in December 2025 –",
